{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2173","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Niko's Tactical Cards"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1.5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Niko is playing a game. Her score is denoted by an integer $$$k$$$ which is $$$0$$$ initially."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The game has $$$n$$$ turns. On the $$$i$$$-th turn, Niko is given a red card with an integer $$$a_i$$$ on it, as well as a blue card with an integer $$$b_i$$$ on it. She must choose exactly "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"one"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the cards and update her score according to her choice:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If she chooses the red card, her score becomes $$$k - a_i$$$, where $$$k$$$ is her score before the turn. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If she chooses the blue card, her score becomes $$$b_i - k$$$, where $$$k$$$ is her score before the turn. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After this, the game proceeds to the next turn, or ends if it is the $$$n$$$-th turn."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to find the maximum possible score Niko can obtain at the end of the game."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^3$$$). The description of the test cases follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 10^5$$$) — the number of turns."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ ($$$-10^9 \\le a_i \\le 10^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line of each test case contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$b_1, b_2, \\ldots, b_n$$$ ($$$-10^9 \\le b_i \\le 10^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output a single integer — the maximum possible score Niko can obtain at the end of the game."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n3\n4 -8 -1\n-3 -7 0\n5\n-3 1 0 7 1\n-5 3 -1 4 -5\n5\n-7 7 5 4 9\n-9 -3 3 2 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n12\n27"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kin